===
# Mixed Content Columns

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column; width: '50%'}
### Code Example

```javascript
function greet(name) {
    return `Hello, ${name}!`;
}

console.log(greet("World"));
```
:::

::: {.column; width: '50%'}
### Output
When you run this code, you'll see:

> Hello, World!

Simple and elegant!
:::
::::

